/-!
# D₄ pair-comparison certificates: resource-safe assembly

Every original public certificate theorem is assembled from small closed
kernel checks. No entire node/row collection is evaluated in this module.
-/
namespace VOA.DeligneAudit.DeligneDivisor.D4

open VOA.DeligneAudit.DeligneSector.Sparse VOA.DeligneAudit.DeligneDivisor

